  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Saj Food Products Private Limited vs The State Of West Bengal & Ors on 5 March, 2025 05-03-2025 Item No.17 In The High Court At Calcutta Subrata Constitutional Writ Jurisdiction Bhattacharyya Appellate Side Ar(C) Wpa No.1908 of 2025 Saj Food Products Private Limited -vs- The State of West Bengal & Ors. Mr. Abhratosh Majumdar, sr. adv. Mr. Sayan Sinha Mr. Nilanjan Bhattacharya Mr. K. Roy. Mr. Adil Naser Mr. K. Roy ... for the petitioner Mr. Biswabrata Basu Mallick Ms. Parna Roy Chowdhury ... for the State Mr. Arijit Majumdar ...for the Union of India Mr. Amit Mehra Ms. Pramita Banerjee Mr. Rohan Raj ... for the respondent nos. 3 and 4 1.",
    "facts": "The additive 'tartrazine' is permitted to be added in the food products, such as 'cake, cookies, biscuit, cracker and pies'. 2. In view of the opinion placed before this Court by the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, the subject food product, Top Herbs biscuit, of the petitioner shall be treated as safe for consumption and permitted to be sold in the open market.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned senior advocate representing the petitioner submits that enough harassment and financial loss has been caused to the petitioner because of the issuance of the prohibitory order.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "4. Learned senior advocate representing the petitioner submits that enough harassment and financial loss has been caused to the petitioner because of the issuance of the prohibitory order.",
